  "coverage": [
    "Repeated native getters in main/child frames, dedicated/shared/service workers and storage buckets throw NotSupportedError before factory allocation under exclusion.",
    "Availability probes retain property/constructor presence without acquiring a factory.",
    "Selected DevTools factory, observer and clear operations reject before effects; clear tests retain localStorage/cookie sentinels.",
    "Quota estimates, CacheStorage, cookies, enabled DOM stores, context disposal and allowed storage-state restoration continue to work.",
    "Runner storageState defaults reach preflight for default fixtures, manual contexts and owned pages; explicit context options override defaults.",
    "Cookie-only restore remains allowed. Pinned Playwright restoration of any origin internally reads IndexedDB, including localStorage-only state; its private adapter rejects this profile before effects. Flashwright restores localStorage without IndexedDB.",
    "Caught native violations fail teardown. Retry uses a distinct attempt/browser with the same frozen contract.",
    "Six traced fresh partitions produce three real IndexedDB contexts in the full arm and three omission markers in the excluded arm.",
    "240 unchanged application tests pass across both engines, two apps, one/four workers and discovery/restricted profiles. Another 240 pass in the strict complete-run screen."
  ],
  "retainedFailures": [
    {
      "stage": "native-build",
      "detail": "Initial exception-signature/IDL edits were interrupted during generation. Existing signatures were restored and the getter guard uses the V8 exception path. Successful renderer build required 84 final steps and about 70 seconds; the initial generator count did not represent thousands of C++ compilations."
    },
    {
      "stage": "reference-storage-restore",
